add(328930,'parked_uniform_asymptotic_gap','primary exact Conjecture 17 and preceding good-spacing context read','For each positive density delta, constants c1,c2,c3 depend ONLY on delta, uniformly in n and the dense grid subset.','The one-dimensional selection argument does not preserve both coordinate prefix counts after tensoring or selecting rows separately. The two-dimensional equality is an exact integer prefix-count condition. No finite n can disprove existence of arbitrary density-dependent constants.','Need an asymptotic dense obstruction family defeating every constants choice, or a uniform simultaneous prefix-count selection theorem. A fixed-grid diagnostic is not a finite decision procedure for this conjecture.','1409.8535, final Conjecture 17, following Lemma 12 context')
